  "instructions": [
    "Melt butter in a pan over medium heat. Add the onion, garlic, coriander leaves, and a pinch of salt, and cook until the onion is translucent. Sprinkle the flour over the onion mixture and cook for 1 minute, stirring constantly. Gradually add the heavy cream, whisking continuously, and cook for 2 minutes, or until the mixture thickens. Remove from heat and stir in the diced tomatoes and sugar. Season with salt and pepper to taste. ",
    "Pour the mixture into a fondue pot and place over low heat. ",
